\begin{align*} 8888 \div 8 &= 1111 \text{ R } 0 \\ 1111 \div 8 &= 138 \text{ R } 7 \\ 138 \div 8 &= 17 \text{ R } 2 \\ 17 \div 8 &= 2 \text{ R } 1 \\ 2 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ R } 2 \end{align*}
Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we have $8888_{10} = 21270_8$.

Now, we convert $21270_8$ to base 10:
$$21270_8 = 2 \cdot 8^4 + 1 \cdot 8^3 + 2 \cdot 8^2 + 7 \cdot 8^1 + 0 \cdot 8^0 = 2 \cdot 4096 + 1 \cdot 512 + 2 \cdot 64 + 7 \cdot 8 + 0 \cdot 1$$
$$= 8192 + 512 + 128 + 56 + 0 = 8888$$
The expression for $8888_{10}$ in base 8 is $21270_8$. The sum of the digits is $2+1+2+7+0 = 12$.

